        "TileImage": "$($repository 216804b1-e400-4349-b8c9-e7703bd4fdb8).Image",
        "Description": "Price: Looks like we just missed Hannan. The cargo is heading to her Majesty&apos;s doorstep, under the guise of the company: Fregata. I tipped off an old friend from MI5 and he gave us a lead on Fregata. Apparently, the company has strong ties to high-ranking members of the US bank, Milton Fitzpatrick, including Mateo Perez. The British tried to initiate an international investigation, but failed to achieve it. Since we are disawoved, we will take out Hannan&apos;s operatives and track down Fregata.",
